{"id":"loca","lemma":"loca","pos":"noun","rank":527,"glosses":["a madwoman, female equivalent of loco","slut (usually said of a woman...)","an effeminate man or boy"],"ipa":"/ˈloka/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"locas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-loca.wav","examples":[{"text":"Estoy un poco loca.","en":"I'm a little crazy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1191450","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,3,"a bit"]]},{"text":"Mi esposa está loca.","en":"My wife is mad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/103651","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"wife"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"Eres una mujer loca.","en":"You're a crazy woman.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"woman"},null]},{"text":"Mucha gente piensa que estoy loca.","en":"Most people think I'm crazy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/330817","words":[{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"to think, ponder","l":"pensar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"¿Cómo has llegado a esta idea loca?","en":"How did you come up with this crazy idea?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/820142","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"arrived"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"idea"},null]}]}